{"ID":"20240504154529-cageeca","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154529-cageeca","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154529-cageeca\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154529-wyct1fs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607093521-ifdtgtt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1100\u0026#125;","title":"018扁青","updated":"20240705145433"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504154529-wyct1fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504154529-wyct1fs","updated":"20240504154529"}},{"ID":"20240617154113-sshtpu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617154113-sshtpu6","updated":"20240617154113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"扁青20240617_154046"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/扁青20240617_154046-20240617154113-agjl5pq.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240617152856-8h6zv93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617152856-8h6zv93","updated":"20240705145428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617174515-ve2zdzs.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240617174722-87zxlom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617174722-87zxlom","updated":"20240705145433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617174722-tuz9xns.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614163454-gsl8byy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163454-gsl8byy"}},{"ID":"20240614163526-0apn2y3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-0apn2y3","updated":"20240614163531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163526-2egox31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-2egox31","updated":"20240614163526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163526-d02aczn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-d02aczn","updated":"20240614163526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主目痛，明目，折跌，痈肿，金创不疗，破积聚，解毒气（《御览》引作辟毒），利精神。久服，轻身不老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163526-3gz4dn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-3gz4dn5","updated":"20240614163526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：扁青，神农雷公小寒无毒，生蜀郡，治丈夫内绝，令人有子（《御览》引云，治痈脾风痹，久服轻身）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163526-tioqsbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-tioqsbc","updated":"20240614163526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生朱崖武都朱提，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163526-g8rcahk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-g8rcahk","updated":"20240614163526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：扁青出宏农豫章。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163526-7u3xv4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163526-7u3xv4q","updated":"20240614163526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上，玉、石，上品一十八种，旧同。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163535-olgwst0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163535-olgwst0"}},{"ID":"20240614163536-30cqc7h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163536-30cqc7h","updated":"20240614163539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163536-c62l7oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163536-c62l7oc","updated":"20240614163536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。主目痛，明目，养肝之功。折跌痈肿，金疮不瘳。收涩敛肌之功。破积聚，消肝邪也。解毒瓦斯，利精神。久服，轻身不老。精气所结之物，故能除毒，益精，增年也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163536-8rt7og7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163536-8rt7og7","updated":"20240614163536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《内经》云∶五脏六腑之精，皆上注于目。故目虽属肝之窍，而白乃肺之精也。五行之中，火能舒光照物，而不能鉴物，惟金之明，乃能鉴物。石体属金，故石药皆能明目。而扁青生于山之有金处，盖金气精华之所结也，又色青属肝，于目疾尤宜。凡草木中，得秋金之气者亦然。凡物精华所结者，皆得天地清粹之气以成，而秽浊不正之气不得干之，故皆有解毒之功。其非精华所结，而亦能解毒者，则必物性之相制，或以毒攻毒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163545-8q8hsue","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163545-8q8hsue"}},{"ID":"20240614163546-ujtlswu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163546-ujtlswu","updated":"20240614163552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163546-6cjtxok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163546-6cjtxok","updated":"20240614163546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主治目痛，明目，折跌痈肿，金创不瘳，破积聚，解毒瓦斯，利精神，去寒热风痹，及丈夫茎中百病，益精。久服轻身，不老。生朱崖山谷武都、朱提，采无时。《仙经》世方都无用者。朱崖郡先属交州，在南海中，晋代省之，朱提郡今属宁州。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163607-qekwfee","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163607-qekwfee"}},{"ID":"20240614163609-cgegi16","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163609-cgegi16","updated":"20240614163613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163609-ngp56ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163609-ngp56ll","updated":"20240614163609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百八十八"}]},{"ID":"20240614163609-88vtqol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163609-88vtqol","updated":"20240614163609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神农、雷公∶小寒，无毒。生蜀郡。明目，治痈肿、风痹、丈夫内绝，令人有子。久服轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163647-r4drgs3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163647-r4drgs3"}},{"ID":"20240614163648-rfkaupg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163648-rfkaupg","updated":"20240614163702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163648-r0qd96u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163648-r0qd96u","updated":"20240614163648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主目痛明目，折跌痈肿，金创不瘳，破积聚，解毒瓦斯，利精神，去寒热风痹，及丈夫茎中百病，益精。久服轻身、不老。生朱崖山谷武都、朱提，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163648-eqjeogh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163648-eqjeogh","updated":"20240614163648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《仙经》俗方都无用者。朱崖郡先属交州，在南海中，晋代省之，朱提郡今属宁州。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163648-ihoi7x0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163648-ihoi7x0","updated":"20240614163648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案朱崖巴南及林邑、扶南、舶上来者，形块大如拳，其色又青，腹中亦时有空者；武昌者，片块小、而色更佳；兰州、梓州者，形扁作片，而色浅也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163618-ly0zu84","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163618-ly0zu84"}},{"ID":"20240614163620-s24g8b7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163620-s24g8b7","updated":"20240614163624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石青《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163620-7fmked9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163620-7fmked9","updated":"20240614163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（一名扁青．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614163620-ctw6em8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163620-ctw6em8","updated":"20240614163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240614163620-f6zhye0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163620-f6zhye0","updated":"20240614163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240614163620-o7mqyex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163620-o7mqyex","updated":"20240614163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240614163620-eslzste","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163620-eslzste","updated":"20240614163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目痛．明目．折跌痈肿．金疮不瘳．破积聚．解毒瓦斯．利精神．久服轻身不老．去寒热风痹．及丈夫茎中百病．益精．治丈夫内绝．令人有子．吐风痰．癫痫．平肝．"}]},{"ID":"20240614163557-0remwc5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163557-0remwc5"}},{"ID":"20240614163558-igtjl6h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163558-igtjl6h","updated":"20240614163602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163558-liu34cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163558-liu34cr","updated":"20240614163558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俗名石青"}]},{"ID":"20240614163558-3imhx74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163558-3imhx74","updated":"20240614163558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163558-dbx4naa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163558-dbx4naa","updated":"20240614163558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主目痛，明目，折跌痈肿，金疮不瘳，破积聚，解毒瓦斯，利精神。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163558-6v6hu5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163558-6v6hu5a","updated":"20240614163558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石青走肝磨坚积。故《本经》所主皆肝经积聚之病。时珍用吐风痰，研细温水灌下即吐，肝虚易惊多痰者宜之。形如缩砂者名鱼目青，主治与扁青无异。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163455-0hts2mz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163455-0hts2mz"}},{"ID":"20240614163456-4sezckl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163456-4sezckl","updated":"20240614163500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163456-ggt6tzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163456-ggt6tzp","updated":"20240614163456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名石青、大青。即今矿物学上的石青。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163456-64ymxak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163456-64ymxak","updated":"20240614163456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163456-dr88hx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163456-dr88hx8","updated":"20240614163456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」顽痰不化等症，兼有明目、利痰、生精、平肝等功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163504-e7zdnf2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163504-e7zdnf2"}},{"ID":"20240614163505-74rgqeh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163505-74rgqeh","updated":"20240614163511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163505-fpub1dj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163505-fpub1dj","updated":"20240614163505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜀郡者块大如拳，其色青，腹中亦时有空者；武昌者块小扁而色更佳。味甘，平，无毒。主折跌痈肿，金疮不瘳。治目痛，破积聚，解毒瓦斯，利精神，去寒热风痹，及丈夫茎中百病，内绝益精，令人有子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163505-ffpx8jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163505-ffpx8jn","updated":"20240614163505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久服轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163516-aioha9s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163516-aioha9s"}},{"ID":"20240614163517-cw9t8n6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163517-cw9t8n6","updated":"20240614163521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁青《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163517-2vj8c6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163517-2vj8c6b","updated":"20240614163517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主目痛、明目，折跌，痈肿，金疮不瘳，破积聚，解毒瓦斯，利精神，去寒热风痹，及丈夫茎中百病，益精。久服轻身，不老。生朱崖山谷、武都、朱提。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163517-ax1unbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163517-ax1unbw","updated":"20240614163517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶《仙经》俗方都无用者。朱崖郡先属交州，在南海中，晋代省之。朱提郡今属宁州。唐本注云∶此即前条陶谓绿青是也。朱崖、巴南及林邑、扶南舶上来者，形块大如拳，其色又青，腹中亦时有空者。武昌者，片块小而色更佳。简州、梓州者，形扁作片，而色浅也。臣禹锡等谨按吴氏云∶扁青，神农、雷公∶小寒，无毒。生蜀郡。治丈夫内绝，令人有子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163517-lbr1oty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163517-lbr1oty","updated":"20240614163517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具绿青条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093516-1b4er55","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607093516-1b4er55"}},{"ID":"20240607093518-kjyilz4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-kjyilz4","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：扁青"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-es6xnql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-es6xnql","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Biǎn Qīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-safkcza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-safkcza","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青（《本经》），碧青（《唐本草》），石青，大青（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-5lnsqiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-5lnsqiv","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-0g0jywt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-0g0jywt","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为碳酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蓝铜矿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-y67nzoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-y67nzoe","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原形态"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产于铜矿氧化带中。单斜晶系。晶体短柱状或板状。通常星粒状、肾状、散射状、土状等块体或被覆在其他铜矿之表面，呈深蓝色。条痕为浅蓝色。光泽呈玻璃状、金刚石状或土状。半透明至不透明。断口呈贝壳状，硬度3.5～4。比重3.7～3.9。性脆。试验与孔雀石同。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-z1s8ztc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-z1s8ztc","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《品汇精要》：\"先捣罗，更以水飞极细，候干，再研用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-1u7v058","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-1u7v058","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸咸，平。有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-otglu42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-otglu42","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-64po0ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-64po0ai","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农、雷公：小寒，无毒。\"\"雷公：咸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-61mdqfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-61mdqfo","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"酸咸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-41v38i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-41v38i4","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祛痰、催吐，破积，明目。治风痰癫痫，惊风，目痛，目翳，创伤，痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-kot2uh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-kot2uh0","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主目痛，明目，折跌，痈肿，金疮不瘳。破积聚，解毒气，利精神。\"\"主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒三虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-7xivb07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-7xivb07","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"治丈夫内绝，令人有子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-3cbs0ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-3cbs0ff","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"去寒热风痹及丈夫茎中百病，益精。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-sjswzpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-sjswzpk","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"吐风痰癫痫，平肝。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-al3bixh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-al3bixh","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服：入丸、散。外用：研细调敷或点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-mq34y7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-mq34y7e","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治顽痰不化：石膏一两（水飞），石绿半两（水飞）。为末，面糊为丸如绿豆大。每服十丸，温汤下。有痰即吐去一、二碗，不损人。（《瑞竹堂经验方》化痰丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-86ijab0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-86ijab0","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小儿急惊风：石青一两，天竹黄五钱，牛黄一分。俱研极细末。每服一、二分，生姜汤调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-6allec9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-6allec9","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治目痛、目痒，并翳膜不明：石青三钱，珍珠一钱。研极细。用银簪脚点少许。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-8ih71dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-8ih71dm","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①苏氏曰，此药善能明目、退翳，镇惊定狂，下痰破结。然终属石药，但中病即已，不可多服久服也。（②方以下出《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-fzl0a95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-fzl0a95","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"石膏，走肝磨坚积，故《本经》所主，皆肝经积聚之病。时珍用吐风痰，研细温水灌下即吐，肝虚易惊多痰者宜之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-0nf439s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-0nf439s","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"备注"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》另有空青、曾青，亦属蓝铜矿的矿石，空青为形圆中空者，曾青为呈层状者。详\"空青\"、\"曾青\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-n3sszku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-n3sszku","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-y10gsof","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-y10gsof","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：扁青"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-7n4mur9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-7n4mur9","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Biǎn Qīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-i0s35ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-i0s35ss","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英文名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Azurite"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-er57uok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-er57uok","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青、碧青、鱼目青、石青、大青"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-aj7uato","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-aj7uato","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-5hot68y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-5hot68y","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》：此扁青，即陶谓绿青是也。朱崖、巴南及林邑、扶南舶上来者，形块大如拳，其色又青，腹中亦时有空者。武昌者片块小而色更佳。简州、梓州者形扁作片而色浅也。陶所云白青，今空青圆如铁珠，色白而腹不空者是也。研之色白如碧，亦谓之碧青，不入画用，无空青时亦用之，名鱼目青，以形似鱼目故也，今出简州、梓州者好。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-1n5n7np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-1n5n7np","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：扁青，苏恭言即绿青者，非也，今之石青是矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-tlo2s99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-tlo2s99","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为碳酸盐类矿物蓝铜矿的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-mpncr9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-mpncr9k","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Azurite"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-3eulqj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-3eulqj4","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原形态"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单斜晶系。晶体短柱状或板状。通常呈粒状、肾状、散射状、土状等块体或被覆在其他铜矿之表面，呈深蓝色。条痕为浅篮色。光泽呈玻璃状、金刚石状或土状。半透明至不透明。断口呈贝壳状，硬度3.5-4。比重3.7-3.9。性脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-c2hjgll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-c2hjgll","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生境分部"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：成因产状与绿青（孔雀石）相似。当温度增高时，扁青（蓝铜矿）可能变为绿青（孔雀石），而当干燥季节，并在有足够数量碳酸的条件下，绿青（孔雀石）可转变为扁青（蓝铜 矿）。共存有孔雀石、石英、褐铁矿乃至其他粘土矿物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-dj9esw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-dj9esw3","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：产于吉林、辽宁、内蒙古、青海、湖北、湖南、广东、四川、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-ko9w3n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-ko9w3n3","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别 本品为不规则块状。蓝色，有时其中夹有浅蓝色条块；条痕浅蓝色。玻璃光泽，半透明；浅蓝色者土状光泽，不透明。体较重，质硬脆，可砸碎，断面不平坦。气微，味淡。以块大、色蓝、具玻璃光泽、无杂石者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-h5969da","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-h5969da","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 透射偏光镜下：浅蓝至暗蓝色，在厚的薄片中多色性与吸收性明显，吸收公式：Ng\u003eNm\u003eHp。斜消光，消光角：Ng∧C=13°。二轴晶；正旋旋旋旋光性，光轴角2V=68°。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-aovv02c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-aovv02c","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反射偏光镜下：反射色呈灰色，稍带肉红色。非均性显着，反射率7%-9%（伏黄）于镜下见存孔雀石，往往分布在蓝铜矿、蛋白石的裂隙中。蓝铜矿90%左右，蛋白石、孔雀石5%左右。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-6az8hnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-6az8hnz","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"化学成分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主含碱式碳酸铜[2CuCO3·Cu(OH)2]。其中氧化铜(CuO)69.2%，二氧化碳(CO2)25.6%，水分(H2O)5.2%,尚含铅、锌、铜、钙、镁、钛、铁、铝等元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-al0qk4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-al0qk4r","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鉴别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)取本品粉末，加入稀盐酸，显碳酸盐的各种反应。详见“绿青”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-gjpebzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-gjpebzs","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)本品具铜盐的各种反应。详见“绿青”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-c91hg7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-c91hg7n","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)X射线衍射分析曲线 5.18(6),5.09(8),4.98(6),3.53(10),2.51(5)。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-sm4bbvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-sm4bbvx","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(4)差热分析曲线 吸热390℃(大)，980℃（大）；放热780℃（微），970℃（微）；390℃（微）失重40%。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-5zi5w4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-5zi5w4u","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《品汇精要》：先捣罗，更以水飞极细，候干，再研用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-cx4qdg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-cx4qdg0","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸；咸；平；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-5464755","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-5464755","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-raslngd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-raslngd","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涌吐风痰；明目；解毒。主癫痫；惊风；痰涎壅盛；目翳；痈肿"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-kax1mny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-kax1mny","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服：入丸、散。外用：研细调敷或点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-fylhr0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-fylhr0o","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服宜慎。不宜多服久服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-g5rhryd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-g5rhryd","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治顽痰不化： 石青一两(水飞)，石绿半两(水飞)。为末，面糊为丸如绿豆大。每服十丸，温汤下。有痰即吐去一、二碗，不损人。(《瑞竹堂经验方》化痰丸)②治小儿急惊风：石青一两，天竹黄五钱，牛黄一分。俱研极细末。每服一、二分，生姜汤调下。(《本草汇言》)③治目痛、目痒，并翳膜不明:石青三钱，珍珠一钱。研极细。用银簪脚点少许。(《本草汇言》)"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-qwl8vxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-qwl8vxf","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 苏氏曰，此药善能明目、退翳，镇惊定狂，下痰破结。然终属石药，但中病即已，不可多服久服也。(《本草汇言》)2.《本经逢原》：石青，走肝磨坚积，故《本经》所主，皆肝经积聚之病。时珍用吐风痰，研细温水灌下即吐，肝虚易惊多痰者宜之。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-3pn4ggs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-3pn4ggs","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主目痛，明目，折跌，痈肿，金疮不瘳。破积聚，解毒气，利精神。主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒三虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-wyg3i40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-wyg3i40","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《吴普本草》： 治丈夫内绝，令人有子。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-gifduda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-gifduda","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《别录》：去寒热风痹及丈夫茎中百病，益精。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-xxml6sg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-xxml6sg","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《纲目》：吐风痰癫癎，平肝。"}]},{"ID":"20240607093518-emlf172","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093518-emlf172","updated":"20240607093518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607093519-yi8be0r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607093519-yi8be0r"}},{"ID":"20240607093521-ifdtgtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607093521-ifdtgtt"}}]}